<view class="page"><view class="notice">禁止直接覆盖课时余额。赠课、补课、错误修正和人工扣课都必须填写原因并写入lessonLedger。</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">学员 *</text><picker range="{{students}}" range-key="name" value="{{studentIndex}}" bindchange="student"><view class="picker">{{students[studentIndex].name}} · 当前{{students[studentIndex].remainingLessons}}节</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">调整节数 *</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{delta}}" data-key="delta" bindinput="field" placeholder="赠课填2，扣课填-2"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">调整原因 *</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如：暑期活动赠送2节"/></view></view><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">确认并写入课时流水</button></view>
